{%- comment -%}
  "Stock bar" section: an exact copy of the Bioroot "November Batch / 83% Sold" bar, built from their own code. One pale pink strip: the title in red, a solid red "% Sold" tag, and a thin red progress bar that fills the rest of the row. Same sizes, colours and spacing as the original. Like the original it has no animation (their code has none), so it is just a still bar.
  No app, no script, no library, loads fast. The Poppins font (the one Bioroot uses) loads without slowing the page; set mb_poppins to false to use your theme font instead.

  WHERE: Online Store > Themes > Customize > the page > Add section or block > Custom Liquid, drag it where you want it (for example under the benefits list, above the Add to cart button), paste this in.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead.
  mb_label = the title on the left. mb_percent = how much is sold, a number from 0 to 100 (no % sign). mb_tag = the text in the red tag (leave empty and it writes it for you, for example 83% Sold).
  The other lines are the original values (colours, sizes, spacing). Only change them if you want it different from Bioroot: mb_margin = space above and below the strip (top-and-bottom then left-and-right).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_label = 'November Batch' -%}
{%- assign mb_percent = '83' -%}
{%- assign mb_tag = '' -%}
{%- assign mb_poppins = true -%}
{%- assign mb_bg = '#fdf0f2' -%}
{%- assign mb_color = '#c8102e' -%}
{%- assign mb_tag_bg = '#c8102e' -%}
{%- assign mb_tag_color = '#ffffff' -%}
{%- assign mb_track = '#f5c6cf' -%}
{%- assign mb_fill = '#c8102e' -%}
{%- assign mb_margin = '16px 0' -%}
{%- assign mb_p = mb_percent | plus: 0 -%}
{%- if mb_p < 0 -%}{%- assign mb_p = 0 -%}{%- elsif mb_p > 100 -%}{%- assign mb_p = 100 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if mb_tag != blank -%}{%- assign mb_tag_txt = mb_tag -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign mb_tag_txt = mb_p | append: '% Sold' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if mb_poppins -%}{%- assign mb_ff = "'Poppins',sans-serif" -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign mb_ff = 'inherit' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if mb_poppins -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@500&display=swap"></noscript>
{%- endif -%}
<style>
.mb-sb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;margin:var(--mb-sb-mg);padding:6px 16px;background:var(--mb-sb-bg);color:var(--mb-sb-c);font-family:var(--mb-sb-ff);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:0;text-align:left;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility}
.mb-sb *{box-sizing:border-box}
.mb-sb .mb-sb__label{display:inline;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;border:0!important;background:none!important;font-family:var(--mb-sb-ff)!important;font-size:14px!important;font-weight:500!important;font-style:normal!important;line-height:1.45!important;letter-spacing:0!important;text-transform:none!important;text-align:left!important;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--mb-sb-c)!important}
.mb-sb .mb-sb__tag{display:inline;flex:none;margin:0!important;padding:2px 12px!important;border:0!important;border-radius:2px!important;background:var(--mb-sb-tb)!important;font-family:var(--mb-sb-ff)!important;font-size:14px!important;font-weight:500!important;font-style:normal!important;line-height:1.45!important;letter-spacing:0!important;text-transform:none!important;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--mb-sb-tc)!important}
.mb-sb .mb-sb__bar{display:block!important;flex:1;min-width:40px;height:8px!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;border:0!important;border-radius:9px!important;overflow:hidden!important;background:var(--mb-sb-track)!important}
.mb-sb .mb-sb__fill{display:block!important;width:var(--mb-sb-p)!important;height:100%!important;margin:0!important;padding:0!important;border:0!important;border-radius:0!important;background:var(--mb-sb-fill)!important}
</style>

<div class="mb-sb" style="--mb-sb-p:{{ mb_p }}%;--mb-sb-mg:{{ mb_margin }};--mb-sb-ff:{{ mb_ff }};--mb-sb-bg:{{ mb_bg }};--mb-sb-c:{{ mb_color }};--mb-sb-tb:{{ mb_tag_bg }};--mb-sb-tc:{{ mb_tag_color }};--mb-sb-track:{{ mb_track }};--mb-sb-fill:{{ mb_fill }}">
<span class="mb-sb__label">{{ mb_label | escape_once }}</span><span class="mb-sb__tag">{{ mb_tag_txt | escape_once }}</span>
  <span class="mb-sb__bar" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="{{ mb_p }}" aria-label="{{ mb_tag_txt | escape_once }}">
    <span class="mb-sb__fill" style="width: {{ mb_p }}%;"></span>
  </span>
</div>
